# Frontend -> Backend API base URL
#
# The app will use the first defined value in this order:
# 1) REACT_APP_API_BASE_URL
# 2) REACT_APP_API_BASE
# 3) REACT_APP_BACKEND_URL
# ...and will fallback to http://localhost:3001 if none are set.
#
# In development with local backend:
# REACT_APP_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3001
#
# In preview environments, you may get:
# REACT_APP_API_BASE=https://<host>:3001
#
# In production:
# REACT_APP_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.example.com
REACT_APP_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3001
=======
